---
---

<section class="py-24 overflow-hidden" id="caracteristicas">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6">
    
    <!-- Feature 1: Estimación Salarial -->
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-center mb-32">
      <div class="order-2 lg:order-1 relative">
        <div class="absolute -inset-4 bg-brand-primary/20 blur-[80px] rounded-full -z-10"></div>
        <div class="glass-card p-2 transform rotate-y-[5deg] hover:rotate-y-0 transition-transform duration-500">
          <img src="/images/feature_salary.png" alt="Estimación Salarial Mockup" class="w-full h-auto rounded-xl border border-white/10" />
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="order-1 lg:order-2">
        <h3 class="text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-6">Estimación Salarial Precisa</h3>
        <p class="text-text-secondary text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6">
          Nuestra Inteligencia Artificial evalúa tu stack tecnológico, experiencia y nivel de idiomas para calcular un rango salarial realista basado en el mercado actual.
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-4">
          <li class="flex items-center gap-3 text-white">
            <svg class="text-brand-primary" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><path d="m9 11 3 3L22 4"/></svg>
            Cálculo personalizado por tecnologías
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-3 text-white">
            <svg class="text-brand-primary" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><path d="m9 11 3 3L22 4"/></svg>
            Desglose de nivel (Junior a Senior)
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-3 text-white">
            <svg class="text-brand-primary" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><path d="m9 11 3 3L22 4"/></svg>
            Evaluación del impacto del idioma
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Feature 2: Compatibilidad Laboral -->
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-center mb-32">
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-6">Compatibilidad Laboral (Job Match)</h3>
        <p class="text-text-secondary text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6">
          Deja de adivinar si estás calificado para un puesto. Nuestra IA compara tu perfil técnico exacto contra las descripciones de cargo reales del mercado.
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-4">
          <li class="flex items-center gap-3 text-white">
            <svg class="text-brand-secondary" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><path d="m9 11 3 3L22 4"/></svg>
            Porcentaje de compatibilidad real
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-3 text-white">
            <svg class="text-brand-secondary" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><path d="m9 11 3 3L22 4"/></svg>
            Identificación de habilidades faltantes
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-3 text-white">
            <svg class="text-brand-secondary" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><path d="m9 11 3 3L22 4"/></svg>
            Recomendaciones de roles alternativos
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="relative">
        <div class="absolute -inset-4 bg-brand-secondary/20 blur-[80px] rounded-full -z-10"></div>
        <div class="glass-card p-2 transform rotate-y-[-5deg] hover:rotate-y-0 transition-transform duration-500">
          <img src="/images/feature_match.png" alt="Job Match AI Mockup" class="w-full h-auto rounded-xl border border-white/10" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Feature 3: Rutas de Crecimiento -->
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-center mb-32">
      <div class="order-2 lg:order-1 relative">
        <div class="absolute -inset-4 bg-blue-500/20 blur-[80px] rounded-full -z-10"></div>
        <div class="glass-card p-2 transform rotate-y-[5deg] hover:rotate-y-0 transition-transform duration-500">
          <img src="/images/feature_growth.png" alt="Rutas de Crecimiento Mockup" class="w-full h-auto rounded-xl border border-white/10" />
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="order-1 lg:order-2">
        <h3 class="text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-6">Rutas de Crecimiento Acelerado</h3>
        <p class="text-text-secondary text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6">
          Si quieres aumentar tu salario en un 20% o ascender a Senior, Valora te construye un mapa exacto de lo que debes aprender, omitiendo el ruido de internet.
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-4">
          <li class="flex items-center gap-3 text-white">
            <svg class="text-blue-400" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><path d="m9 11 3 3L22 4"/></svg>
            Sugerencias de tecnologías en demanda
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-3 text-white">
            <svg class="text-blue-400" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><path d="m9 11 3 3L22 4"/></svg>
            Certificaciones clave recomendadas
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-3 text-white">
            <svg class="text-blue-400" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><path d="m9 11 3 3L22 4"/></svg>
            Análisis de impacto salarial esperado
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Feature 4: Valoración de Proyectos -->
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-center">
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-6">Valoración de Proyectos Personales</h3>
        <p class="text-text-secondary text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6">
          ¿Hiciste un clon de Netflix o un sistema de inventario? Añade tus proyectos y Valora calculará qué tanto aumentan tu atractivo para los reclutadores.
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-4">
          <li class="flex items-center gap-3 text-white">
            <svg class="text-orange-400" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><path d="m9 11 3 3L22 4"/></svg>
            Evaluación técnica de tu código
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-3 text-white">
            <svg class="text-orange-400" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><path d="m9 11 3 3L22 4"/></svg>
            Competencias demostradas automáticamente
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-3 text-white">
            <svg class="text-orange-400" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><path d="m9 11 3 3L22 4"/></svg>
            Impacto directo en tu estimación salarial
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="relative">
        <div class="absolute -inset-4 bg-orange-500/20 blur-[80px] rounded-full -z-10"></div>
        <div class="glass-card p-2 transform rotate-y-[-5deg] hover:rotate-y-0 transition-transform duration-500">
          <img src="/images/feature_projects.png" alt="Valoración de Proyectos Mockup" class="w-full h-auto rounded-xl border border-white/10" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
